{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/nobu-residences-aldar-properties-saadiyat-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":34,"crm_id":"4593","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Nobu Residences","slug":"nobu-residences-aldar-properties-saadiyat-island","display_address":"Saadiyat Island","building_type":["apartment","loft","penthouse","villa"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Aldar Properties","price":8000000,"display_price":"8M","lattitude":25.198529,"longitude":55.3580669,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Enter a place where Japanese tradition blends with Middle Eastern culture, Aldar Nobu Residences at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/saadiyat-island/\">Saadiyat Island's</a> Cultural District. Located next to the hotel and only seven minutes from downtown Abu Dhabi, the development features elegant Nobu-branded residences. Overlooking the iconic Guggenheim Abu Dhabi, these beachside residences offer <strong>1 to 3-bedroom apartments, 2-bedroom lofts, 4-bedroom Nobu villas and penthouses.</strong></p><p>Residents of Nobu Residences by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-aldar-properties/\">Aldar </a>are invited to live a life of understated luxury with exclusive access to a host of world-class amenities—from the grand lobby lounge and spa facilities to the rooftop bar and Nobu Restaurant. Register your interest today and become part of a community that celebrates beauty, culture, and refined living.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Aldar_Nobu_Residences_at_Saadiyat_Island_3d88d212e3.jpg","hash":"Aldar_Nobu_Residences_at_Saadiyat_Island_3d88d212e3","name":"Aldar Nobu Residences at