unning sea and Guggenheim views.</li><li>Exceptional Amenities: Enjoy beach access, infinity pools, a private cinema lounge, wellness and meditation areas, kids' play zones, rooftop gardens, retail outlets, co-working spaces, and more.</li><li>The exclusive penthouse spans an entire floor, featuring a dedicated private elevator and a vast terrace complete with its own private pool.</li><li>Aldar Assurance: Developed by Aldar Properties, one of the UAE’s most trusted and award-winning developers, ensuring quality, transparency, and reliability.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1473,"cta":{"id":2251,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Location_8f242aa6b3.jpg","hash":"Location_8f242aa6b3","name":"Location"},"style":null,"title":"Middle East's First Nobu Residences in the Prestigious Mamsha Al Saadiyat","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Nestled in the heart of Saadiyat Island’s Cultural District, Aldar Nobu Residences enjoys a truly iconic location surrounded by some of the world’s most prestigious landmarks, including the Louvre Abu Dhabi, the upcoming Guggenheim Museum, and the Zayed National Museum. This vibrant area blends natural beauty with cultural sophistication, offering pristine white-sand beaches, protected coastal landscapes, and a thriving arts and lifestyle scene.</p><ul><li>Saadiyat Grove – 2 minutes</li><li>Guggenheim Abu Dhabi – 3 minutes</li><li>Zayed National Museum – 4 minutes</li><li>Manarat Al Saadiyat – 4 minutes</li><li>Louvre Abu Dhabi – 5 minutes</li><li>Cranleigh British School Abu Dhabi – 5 minutes</li><li>Soul Beach, Saadiyat Island – 5 minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3853,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazon